{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 44,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.276031494140625,
        399.7471618652344,
        51.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "First, good information is important for the management and follow-up of index cases and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58220291137695,
        54.273040771484375,
        399.8190002441406,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "their contacts. Secondly, systematic collection of data will permit analyses of the yield of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.65420150756836,
        66.27005004882812,
        400.05352783203125,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "contact investigations overall and for speciﬁc groups and epidemiological settings. Thirdly,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.447200775146484,
        78.26705932617188,
        399.6392517089844,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "data on indicators of care are useful for evaluating programme performance objectives. Data",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.47420120239258,
        90.26406860351562,
        399.58538818359375,
        99.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "collection and storage require signiﬁcant work; an investment must be made in designing",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.411190032958984,
        102.27005004882812,
        401.6282958984375,
        111.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "data collection tools and setting up protocols for the collection, entry and analysis of data.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50118637084961,
        114.26705932617188,
        399.7328796386719,
        123.26998901367188
      ],
      "text": "If data are collected but not analysed and used to guide the programme, the effort is wasted.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55900955200195,
        144.09629821777344,
        172.40200805664062,
        153.09629821777344
      ],
      "text": "6.2.7 Conﬁdentiality and consent",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55900955200195,
        156.26400756835938,
        399.7058410644531,
        165.26400756835938
      ],
      "text": "Maintaining conﬁdentiality during contact investigation is a challenge because of the social",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.541011810302734,
        168.26101684570312,
        399.6703796386719,
        177.27902221679688
      ],
      "text": "connections between and among index cases and their contacts. All persons should be treated",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50498580932617,
        180.27603149414062,
        399.9757385253906,
        189.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "with respect, and conﬁdentiality should be maintained. Programme guidelines on conﬁdentiality",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.80198287963867,
        192.27001953125,
        176.34072875976562,
        201.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "and consent should be adhered to.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.798709869384766,
        222.09632873535156,
        147.14468383789062,
        231.09632873535156
      ],
      "text": "6.2.8 Stafﬁng and training",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.798709869384766,
        234.2640380859375,
        399.8824768066406,
        243.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "Contact investigations should be a routine activity of TB control programmes. Where contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.84370803833008,
        246.26104736328125,
        400.2693176269531,
        255.26104736328125
      ],
      "text": "investigation has not previously been done, having dedicated staff, if possible, will greatly",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.095706939697266,
        258.258056640625,
        399.85595703125,
        267.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "facilitate the process. Depending on resources, the people who conduct contact investigations,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.249698638916016,
        270.2730712890625,
        399.8007507324219,
        279.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "if trained properly, may be community volunteers, former TB patients or health care providers.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.2578010559082,
        282.27008056640625,
        399.53973388671875,
        291.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "Regardless of their background, the health care workers who screen index patients and conduct",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.500797271728516,
        294.26708984375,
        399.6473693847656,
        303.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "the contact investigation should speak the language of the patients and contacts and be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.4827995300293,
        306.26409912109375,
        399.6737060546875,
        315.2758483886719
      ],
      "text": "familiar with the social and cultural milieu of the communities in which they work. They",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.499691009521484,
        318.2728576660156,
        399.8623352050781,
        327.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "should be trained in the importance of contact investigation in TB control and in interviewing,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.25669479370117,
        330.2698669433594,
        197.93873596191406,
        339.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "data collection, follow-up and reporting.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.27469253540039,
        360.0961608886719,
        370.2527770996094,
        369.0961608886719
      ],
      "text": "6.2.9 Use of treatment for LTBI among contacts as an individual health intervention",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.29269027709961,
        372.2638854980469,
        399.4574890136719,
        381.2638854980469
      ],
      "text": "Tests for LTBI, including the tuberculin skin test and interferon-gamma release assays, can be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.29269027709961,
        384.2608947753906,
        399.66455078125,
        393.2789001464844
      ],
      "text": "used to identify people at increased risk for developing active TB and who are therefore",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.49967575073242,
        394.15374755859375,
        399.7354736328125,
        405.2759094238281
      ],
      "text": "< candidates for treatment of LTBI (other than children   5 years of age and PLHIV, for whom",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57047653198242,
        408.27008056640625,
        399.7351989746094,
        417.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid preventive treatment is recommended without testing for LTBI (1,4)), once active TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.56147384643555,
        420.26708984375,
        399.7982177734375,
        429.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "is excluded. As the value of providing treatment for LTBI in low- and middle-income countries",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.62447738647461,
        432.26409912109375,
        399.6960754394531,
        441.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "is not proven, it is not recommended as a broad programme approach. In caring for patients",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.522090911865234,
        444.2729187011719,
        399.89422607421875,
        453.2729187011719
      ],
      "text": "exposed to an infectious index case who are at increased risk for developing TB if infected,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.27909469604492,
        456.2699279785156,
        399.54302978515625,
        465.2699279785156
      ],
      "text": "clinicians may, however, test them for LTBI with a tuberculin skin test or interferon-gamma",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.37809371948242,
        468.2669372558594,
        399.72296142578125,
        477.2669372558594
      ],
      "text": "release assay and treat them with isoniazid preventive treatment if LTBI is present. As the risks",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54909133911133,
        480.263916015625,
        399.7498779296875,
        489.263916015625
      ],
      "text": "and beneﬁts of treating LTBI, documented by a recent tuberculin conversion (1) or associated",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5850944519043,
        492.2608947753906,
        399.74896240234375,
        501.2789001464844
      ],
      "text": "with other diseases (such as diabetes mellitus) and conditions, are quantiﬁed, the indications",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.575199127197266,
        504.2716369628906,
        399.7219543457031,
        513.2716674804688
      ],
      "text": "for treatment may be broadened. Unless a plan includes policies and procedures for treating",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54819869995117,
        516.2686767578125,
        223.2771759033203,
        525.2686767578125
      ],
      "text": "LTBI, testing for LTBI should not be undertaken.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.24310302734375,
        651.97265625,
        224.9680938720703,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "42",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}